<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>認識 ENHYPEN</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel+Decorative:wght@700&display=swap');

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Cinzel Decorative', cursive;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #1a1a1a, #330000);
      color: #f5f5f5;
    }

    header {
      background-color: #000;
      padding: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #800000;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: #b30000;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px black;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      background-color: #1a0000;
      padding: 0.5rem;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #fff;
      margin: 0 1rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #ff0000;
    }

    section {
      padding: 2rem;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .member-card {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      padding: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid #800000;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .member-card:hover {
      transform: scale(1.02);
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px #b30000;
    }

    .member-name {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: #ffcccc;
    }

    .interactive-btn {
      background-color: #800000;
      color: white;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .interactive-btn:hover {
      background-color: #b30000;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem;
      background-color: #1a0000;
      border-top: 1px solid #800000;
      color: #999;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>ENHYPEN：吸血鬼的魅力</h1>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#intro">團體介紹</a>
    <a href="#members">成員</a>
    <a href="#interact">互動</a>
  </nav>

  <section id="intro">
    <h2>團體介紹</h2>
    <p>ENHYPEN 是來自韓國的男子音樂組合，於2020年透過選秀節目《I-LAND》出道。他們的音樂融合了現代流行、舞曲與神秘感，特別是吸血鬼世界觀更讓人著迷。</p>
  </section>

  <section id="members">
    <h2>成員介紹</h2>
    <div class="member-card">
      <div class="member-name">JUNGWON（楊正元）</div>
      <p>隊長，擁有強烈的舞台魅力與領導能力。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="member-card">
      <div class="member-name">HEESEUNG（李熙勝）</div>
      <p>主唱與全能型成員，聲音穿透力強。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="member-card">
      <div class="member-name">JAY（朴鐘成）</div>
      <p>韓美混血的個性成員，擁有獨特的表演風格。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="member-card">
      <div class="member-name">JAKE（沈載倫）</div>
      <p>有著溫柔嗓音與穩定台風，來自澳洲。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="member-card">
      <div class="member-name">SUNGHOON（朴成訓）</div>
      <p>冰王子般的外貌，曾是花式滑冰選手。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="member-card">
      <div class="member-name">SUNOO（金善祐）</div>
      <p>甜美笑容與豐富表情的魅力擔當。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="member-card">
      <div class="member-name">NI-KI（西村力）</div>
      <p>來自日本的天才舞者，是最年輕的成員。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="interact">
    <h2>互動小遊戲</h2>
    <p>點擊下方按鈕，選擇你的吸血鬼搭檔！</p>
    <button class="interactive-btn" onclick="choosePartner()">選擇搭檔</button>
    <p id="result"></p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2025 ENHYPEN 粉絲互動頁 | 吸血鬼風格設計</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    function choosePartner() {
      const members = ["JUNGWON", "HEESEUNG", "JAY", "JAKE", "SUNGHOON", "SUNOO", "NI-KI"];
      const chosen = members[Math.floor(Math.random() * members.length)];
      document.getElementById("result").textContent = `你的吸血鬼搭檔是：${chosen}！`;
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
